                <div class="title" data-transid="bran">Locations</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">


                Axi support multi-locations. Locations may be configured to accept only finance
                transactions, only inventory transactions or both. When a location is configured to
                maintain inventory, 2 sub locations are created by default by Axi Main store and
                Rejections store.

                All rejections are automatically moved to the rejections
                store. Axi provides the capability of creating one or more sub locations within a
                location. These sub locations may be used as different stores for storing items that are
                in different stages of production till it is shipped.
              </div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">Create </button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">View</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end navigate" data-transid="inloc">Create sub
                  location</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end navigate" data-transid="inloc">View sub
                  locations</button>
