              <div class="desc">Purchase requests can be raised by users from different departments based
                on need. The requests may be approved by identified approving authorities. Axi ERP makes
                it easy to aggregate approved requests and place purchase orders on vendors.</div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">View</button>
