                <div class="title" data-transid="tslpo">Purchase orders</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">Purchase orders can be placed on identified suppliers. The purchase order
                captures all data related to the supplier, list of items, rates, applicable taxes and
                terms of supply. The PO may be electronically sent to suppliers. PO can be raised
                against pending purchase requests. The list of pending requests popup for selection
                clicking on the Pending requests button under the Item particulars section in the PO
                form. To track the status of a PO, type command in the Axi command line at the bottom
                View purchase Order &amp; select the required PO No.</div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
