                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end navigate" data-transid="" data-transtype="ads">Purchase
                  Summary</button>



              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="Module-Child-Wrapper">
          <div class="Module-Child">
            <div class="Module-Img">
              <img src="images/GRN3.jpg">
            </div>

            <div class="module-Content">



              <div class="module-header">
                <div class="icon blue mb-3"><span class="material-icons material-icons-style material-icons-2">assured_workload</span>
                </div>
                <div class="title" data-transid="tsgrn">Good Receipt Note (GRN)</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">Goods received note option is used to record receipt of goods into a
                location and a selected sub location. This is used to record material receipts from
                suppliers. When goods are transferred from a location to another location that may
                attract taxes (like across states in India), this option is used to record the receipt
                of such material transfers. As and when material is received, it is added to the stock
                of that location &amp; sub location.


                Additional expenses like transportation, clearing &amp; forwarding, logistics related
                etc, may be incurred after or while receiving goods from a supplier. These will add to
                the cost of the item. Use this option to record such expenses against a GRN.
              </div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">View</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">Create</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end navigate" data-transid="sbill">Create
                  Additional cost of goods</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end navigate" data-transid="sbill">View
                  Additional cost of goods</button>



              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
        <div class="Module-Child-Wrapper">
          <div class="Module-Child">
