                </div>
                <div class="title" data-transid="stkqc">QC</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">On receiving goods, perform a quality check and identify the damaged or
                faulty goods. QC is done against a GRN. Rejected items are moved to Rejections store
                within that location. Items in the Rejection store are not considered as in stock. Use
                the Fill items button under the Item QC Details section in the QC form to select
                from a list of items in the selected GRN. </div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">View</button>
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">Create</button>

