                </div>
                <div class="title" data-transid="aparo">Supplier bills</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">Suppliers submit bills against goods that were delivered. The supplier
                bills are validated by Axi ERP against the purchase order and the GRN. Deviations are
                raised as exceptions. The bills are automatically posted into GL &amp; AP.</div>
              <div class="Action-Btns">
                <button class="btn-pill mt-auto align-self-end">View</button>
