                <div class="title" data-transid="purre">Purchase returns</div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc">This is a module that enables users to record purchase returns. The
                returns done against a GRN. Returns are posted into GL &amp; AP automatically. Returns
                can be recorded against a GRN or against a purchase bill. In case of a return against a
