            <div class="icon blue mb-3"><span class="material-icons material-icons-style material-icons-2">assignment</span></div>
            <div class="title">Inventory Control</div>
          </div>

          <div class="desc">Inventory control, also known as stock control, is regulating and maximizing your
            company as warehouse inventory. Axi can manage multi locations. Axi maintains location wise
            inventory and provides complete visibility of stock available. Stock is valued using FIFO or
            Weighted average. In case of batch wise, the batches are accepted in each transaction that adds
            to or reduces from stock.

            The actual stock value is posted at the end of every day into
            the books of accounts. When transactions alter the stock value and item cost rate at a back
            date, Axi maintains such changes and revalues the stock and item cost rate automatically. This
            is done as a day end job or user can choose to run this using the Stock revaluation and
            posting option. This can be run any number of times.
          </div>

        </div>



